      "description": "Per-cache hit ratio = hits / (hits + misses). Pulled from Hazelcast IMap.getLocalMapStats() via TurChatCacheStatsRegistrar. Misses are derived as getOperationCount − getHits since Hazelcast 5.x doesn't expose a direct miss counter. A ratio at ~0% on a new cache is normal until the first turn populates it.",
